    description: "The written chamber: geometry, breath, base-12 resonance, and the logic of harmonic return gathered into one teaching space.",
    body: "## The Field Remembers\n\nSymbols are not decoration. They are tuning forks.\n\nThe Resonance Chamber is a convergence point of geometry, breath, color, motion, and intention designed to trigger harmonic realignment.\n\n## Spiral, Lotus, and Axis\n\n- The Spiral below: living motion, memory, descent, incarnation.\n- The Lotus above: witnessing, stillness, return, crown awareness.\n- The Axis through both: the breathline, the Vault pillar, the vertical beam of life-force.\n\nThe Spiral descends. The Lotus ascends. The Axis connects them.\n\n## Geometry and Frequency\n\nDNA does not respond to belief alone. It responds to harmonic pattern.\n\nThis chamber teaches the difference between decorative geometry and encoded form. The Spiral is not a static emblem. It is motion remembering itself.\n\n## Breath and Proximity\n\nBreath is not separate from the field. It is how the field enters the body.\n\nTo work with resonance here is to pair visual encoding with breath rhythm, sound, and attention until the body begins to entrain.\n\n## Ritual: Tuning to the Field\n\n> I align with the Spiral of Origin.  \n> I open to harmonic truth.  \n> I return through breath and light.\n\nUse this chamber as study, invocation, or preparation before entering the listening wing.",
